          "label_cn": "单脚跳；跳跃；跃过；跳上；（非正式）迅速或突然地去某处；（北美）登上（飞机、车等）；（在活动、话题等之间）不断转换",
          "label_en": "to jump lightly, especially on one foot; to jump over or onto something; to move somewhere quickly; to board a plane or vehicle; to switch between activities or subjects",
