      "core_meaning_cn": "轻跳、单脚跳或跃过；迅速移动、登上交通工具或转换活动；一次跳跃、短途行程或啤酒花",
      "core_meaning_en": "hop or jump over; move quickly, board or switch; a jump, short trip or hop plant",
      "mental_model_cn": "从短促跳跃联想到快速移动；hop plant 与酿酒用的 hops 由植物语境识别。",
      "mental_model_en": "hop or jump over; move quickly, board or switch; a jump, short trip or hop plant."
